[{"client_msg_id":"0f500bf1-09e9-45ec-873c-7e4587ffd2ce","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`1000@q` みたいなのはマクロを最初に覚える時にやるやつですね。","ts":"1630075040.099900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uaL5k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5EBDF6D5-8292-4204-A3F8-8889D56C8603","type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"検索ループしても C-c すれば止まりますが、CPU100%にはなりました\nなんとなくカウンタ指定に習慣付けた方が安全っぽいですね","ts":"1630070029.098600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SSc2Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66de21ee-094d-4bdd-b5c8-d779d647471d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":matryoshka-anime: クロ","ts":"1630070024.098500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1tKsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f3373f-bece-4b62-aeec-49e4358392f8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"再帰的マクロ","ts":"1630069974.097300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7pL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a54292af-e810-40ba-90c3-157e1f1231b9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"面白いテクニックだ。。。","ts":"1630069971.097000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4F2v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a67cd8c-a651-47af-9ff3-c50b60eafffd","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"通常のマクロを記録したあとでも、たとえば `x` レジスタに入れていたなら `qX@xq` とすることで再帰的マクロにできるはずですね。\n\nといいながら私は再帰的マクロやらないですが。（代わりに `1000@q` みたいにカウンタ指定する）","ts":"1630069578.094800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/+5S1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99A318E8-13EE-4021-8389-E7311AD44C7A","type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"なるほど。検索がループしない限りは一度のマクロ実行で再帰的マクロがファイル末尾まで一気通貫できるわけですね\nこれは便利だ","ts":"1630069461.093300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jRrk="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9749cdc-7002-4d61-b6cb-9518fa5a2f50","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"途中で移動に失敗したりエラー起きたりするとマクロの再生が止まるというのを利用しているわけですね","ts":"1630068917.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SsI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc733c89-bedf-4085-bb12-1da72e4b40bc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"例えば `q` を使う場合、マクロの最後に `@q` を入れます。そうすると同じマクロが再度再生され、エラーが出るまで実行され続けます。\nこれは例えばマクロを適用したい場所を検索しておいて、`n@qn@q` とやる代わりにマクロの最後を `n@q` にしておけば 1 度の実行で自動的に全部の箇所に順次適用される感じです(最後は検索でジャンプできずに止まる。適用後のテキストも検索で引っかかってしまうとずっと止まらないので注意)","ts":"1630068763.089300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["U01F9KGKAGP","U01H161HVPS","U012MBD7MFZ"]},{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["U8R597E9H","U012MBD7MFZ","U0292R1P865"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EFBA4CC6-D19B-4873-AA06-CBD814FE58EA","type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e マクロの入れ子興味あります\nどんな風にやってるんですか？","ts":"1630068638.087600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nqq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14b25571-132b-45f3-9cdc-09a60f0bc704","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"慣れると便利","ts":"1630067792.085500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a2S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80266d02-9c66-4313-a373-734378f3de96","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"実践Vimでもドットリピートはイチオシだからな","ts":"1630067786.085400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rt4pJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"337a7421-7d79-4825-9c8f-d99f14838645","type":"message","us